@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5211

### Health
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/health

### Current development user
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/me

### Conversations
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/conversations

### Create a conversation
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Monday planning"
}

### Tasks
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/tasks

### Create a task
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy groceries",
  "description": "Pick up groceries after work",
  "priority": "Normal",
  "estimatedMinutes": 30
}

### Commitments
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/commitments

### Planning context
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/planning-context

### Today's plan
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/plans/2026-09-21

### Planning agent (development implementation or OpenAI when OpenAI:ApiKey is configured)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/chat/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": null,
  "message": "I feel overwhelmed. I have work, groceries, the gym, and a tentative dinner."
}

### Calendar events (development provider)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/calendar/events?from=2026-09-21T00:00:00Z&to=2026-09-22T00:00:00Z

### Create calendar event (requires explicit confirmation)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/calendar/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Interview preparation",
  "description": "Prepare for the interview",
  "startTime": "2026-09-21T09:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-09-21T10:30:00Z",
  "location": null,
  "confirmed": true
}

### Google Calendar is opt-in through Google:Enabled and a server-side Google:AccessToken
